{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42324","headline":"回至南康题紫极宫里道士房 · 徐铉","name":"回至南康题紫极宫里道士房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王事信靡盬，饮冰安足辞。\n胡爲拥征传，乃至天南陲。\n天南非我乡，留滞忽踰时。\n还经羽人家，豁若云雾披。\n何以宽吾怀，老庄有微词。\n达士无不可，至人岂偏爲。\n客愁勿复道，爲君吟此诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}